---
description: Voclara project rules (API in Rust, Expo mobile app)
alwaysApply: true
---

Before making changes, read these files and follow them:

- `CLAUDE.md` (repo root): stack, rules (minutes, auth, prompts, logging), local setup and checks.
- `docs/HANDOFF.md`: what is built, what is verified, and the next steps with prompts.
- `apps/mobile/AGENTS.md`: Expo rules for anything in `apps/mobile` (use `npx expo install`, check versioned Expo docs, never edit generated `android/` or `ios/`).
- `apps/mobile/DESIGN.md`: the design system ("Indus & Marigold"). Use `useTheme()` tokens and `src/components`; never hard-code colours, sizes or fonts.

Finish every change with the checks listed in CLAUDE.md, and regenerate
`packages/api-types` after any API change.
